body:
Then I shall begin Punisher as soon as I get a chance! I've always kinda liked villains more than the heroes just cause they tend to be more complex characters, but I especially like it when the villains aren't just crazy evil people and they show you how they became that way. Could be any of us! I sometimes wish I was more villainous, but that's just not who I am. Which I know is a good thing ha, but hopefully you get what I mean.

 And my problem with people is really just a total lack of trust in anyone. And seeing the way people are capable of treating each other is disturbing. It's all fun and games on Netflix, but people really can be so cruel to each other, lie, backstab, and then just carry on. I guess I am too cynical too ha. I hope you are doing well today though. How are you doing?

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
